      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.weforum.org/publications/the-future-of-jobs-report-2025/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">World Economic Forum, Future of Jobs Report 2025</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://nasscom.in/knowledge-center/publications/indias-journey-tech-talent-nation-skills-first-approach" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NASSCOM, India's Journey to a Tech Talent Nation</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://learn.razorpay.in/learn/what-is-freelancing/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Razorpay Learn, What is freelancing and how to start in India</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://razorpay.com/learn/scope-and-challenges-of-freelancers/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Razorpay Learn, Scope and challenges of freelancers in India</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a href="https://www.zoho.com/books/academy/banking-and-payments/payment-terms.html?src=hp-resources-img" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Zoho Books, Payment terms guide</a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</CareerResourceLayout>
